@MessengerWeb_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Register: 200, copy accountId from the response
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

### Same email in another case: 409
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": " TEST@Example.com ",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

### Invalid input: 400
POST {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

###
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Profile before it is filled in: 404
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{accountId}}

### Create or update profile: 204 (404 if the account does not exist)
PUT {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{accountId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Test User",
  "bio": "Hello!"
}

### Profile after: 200
GET {{MessengerWeb_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{accountId}}

###
